Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:50.00,Label,,0,0,0,,LOCAL MODE | EDITED UI WALKTHROUGH
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:00:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,LOCAL VOX: real Gemma on 24 fictional tickets. Edited captures; this is not a timing benchmark.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.00,0:00:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Give VOX a bounded instruction: triage, research, tag, draft two replies. Ask before sending.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:20.00,0:00:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Review the six-step plan. Nothing executes until the plan is approved.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.00,0:00:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Temporal and Mastra execute safe work, with deliberate pre-write retry demonstrations.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:48.00,0:01:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,24 tickets triaged. Seven labels. Two drafts. Zero simulated sends before approval.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:00.00,0:01:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Read the draft and its source. Approve one send inside the fictional helpdesk.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.00,0:01:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,One reply remains pending. Approval of the first did not authorize the second.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:20.00,0:01:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Reject the second reply. The draft is preserved; nothing is delivered externally.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:33.00,0:01:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The same run completes: one simulated send, one rejection, zero pending decisions.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:42.00,0:01:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Four local model requests. External steps skipped. Cloud voice and manual time saved are not measured here.
